  <title>Exploratory Data Analysis</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      This chapter introduces exploratory data analysis using a real dataset from the
      National Survey of Family Growth (NSFG), which is conducted by the CDC to gather
      information about families and health in the United States.
    </p>
